@startuml seq-05-xu-ly-don-dong-goi-va-giao-nhan
title Sơ đồ tuần tự: Xử lý đơn hàng, Đóng gói (tiêu thụ giữ chỗ) và Giao nhận vận chuyển

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 185
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ActorBorderColor #1E293B
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam BoundaryBorderColor #1E293B
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ControlBorderColor #1E293B
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam EntityBorderColor #1E293B
skinparam EntityBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #1E293B
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam ArrowColor #1E293B
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor #E2E8F0

hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Quản lý" as Manager
actor "Nhân viên\nxử lý / Kho" as Staff
actor "Shipper" as Shipper
boundary "Web / Mobile App" as App
control "OrderProcessing &\nWarehouse / Shipping Ctrl" as Ctrl
control "OrderProcessing, Warehouse\n& Shipping Service" as Svc
entity "Models &\nInventoryService" as Model
database "Database\n(orders, shipments, inventory)" as DB

== 1. Xác nhận đơn và Chuẩn bị đóng gói ==
Manager -> App : Xác nhận đơn hàng trực tuyến
activate App
App -> Ctrl : POST /api/v1/order-processing/orders/:id/confirm
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> Svc : confirm(orderId, body, userId)
activate Svc
Svc -> Model : confirmOnlineOrder(orderId)
activate Model
Model -> DB : BEGIN; transitionOrder(pending -> confirmed);\nINSERT order_processing_tasks (status='pending'); COMMIT
activate DB
DB --> Model : Đơn đã xác nhận
deactivate DB
Model --> Svc : result
deactivate Model
Svc --> Ctrl : result
deactivate Svc
Ctrl --> App : 200 OK
deactivate Ctrl
App --> Manager : Hiển thị trạng thái 'confirmed'
deactivate App

Staff -> App : Nhận xử lý & chuyển Sẵn sàng đóng gói
activate App
App -> Ctrl : PATCH /api/v1/order-processing/orders/:id/task
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> Svc : update(orderId, { status: 'ready_to_pack' }, actor)
activate Svc
Svc -> Model : updateTaskStatus(...)
activate Model
Model -> DB : BEGIN; transitionOrder(confirmed -> ready_to_pack);\nUPDATE order_processing_tasks; COMMIT
activate DB
DB --> Model : Đơn sẵn sàng đóng gói
deactivate DB
Model --> Svc : result
deactivate Model
Svc --> Ctrl : result
deactivate Svc
Ctrl --> App : 200 OK
deactivate Ctrl
App --> Staff : Cho phép quét SKU để đóng gói
deactivate App

== 2. Đóng gói đơn hàng và Tiêu thụ giữ chỗ ==
Staff -> App : Quét đủ SKU/số lượng và nhấn Đóng gói
activate App
App -> Ctrl : POST /api/v1/warehouse/orders/:id/pack
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> Svc : packOrder(orderId, body, userId)
activate Svc
Svc -> Model : packOnlineOrder(...)
activate Model
Model -> DB : BEGIN; Kiểm tra trạng thái 'ready_to_pack';\nconsumeReservation (trừ quantity & reserved_quantity,\nstatus='consumed', ghi inventory_transactions)
activate DB
DB --> Model : Đã xuất kho giữ chỗ
deactivate DB
Model -> DB : transitionOrder(ready_to_pack -> packed); COMMIT
activate DB
DB --> Model : Đơn ở trạng thái 'packed'
deactivate DB
Model --> Svc : packedOrder
deactivate Model
Svc --> Ctrl : packedOrder
deactivate Svc
Ctrl --> App : 200 OK
deactivate Ctrl
App --> Staff : Hoàn tất đóng gói đơn hàng
deactivate App

== 3. Tạo vận đơn và Cập nhật giao nhận ==
Manager -> App : Tạo vận đơn & gán Shipper
activate App
App -> Ctrl : POST /api/v1/shipping/shipments
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> Svc : create(body, actor)
activate Svc
Svc -> Model : createShipment(...)
activate Model
Model -> DB : BEGIN; INSERT shipments (status='assigned');\ntransitionOrder(packed -> handover); COMMIT
activate DB
DB --> Model : Vận đơn mới tạo
deactivate DB
Model --> Svc : shipment
deactivate Model
Svc --> Ctrl : shipment
deactivate Svc
Ctrl --> App : 201 Created
deactivate Ctrl
App --> Manager : Hiển thị vận đơn đã bàn giao
deactivate App

Shipper -> App : Nhận giao (shipping) rồi cập nhật\nGiao thành công (delivered) / Hoàn trả (returned)
activate App
App -> Ctrl : PATCH /api/v1/shipping/shipments/:id/status
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> Svc : updateStatus(shipmentId, body, actor)
activate Svc
Svc -> Model : updateShipmentStatus(...)
activate Model
Model -> DB : BEGIN; UPDATE shipments;\ntransitionOrder(handover -> shipping -> delivered | returned);\nCOMMIT
activate DB
DB --> Model : Trạng thái vận đơn & đơn hàng mới
deactivate DB
Model --> Svc : shipment
deactivate Model
Svc --> Ctrl : shipment
deactivate Svc
Ctrl --> App : 200 OK
deactivate Ctrl
App --> Shipper : Cập nhật kết quả giao hàng
deactivate App

@enduml
